# Only needed when the SPA and API are hosted on DIFFERENT origins with no
# reverse proxy in front (e.g. SPA on app.example.com, API on api.example.com).
# Leave empty when same-origin is in play - dev proxies via Vite, the docker
# image proxies via nginx, so no configuration is needed there.
#
# Server side must then set: COOKIE_CROSS_SITE="true"
# and include the SPA origin in CORS_ORIGINS.
VITE_API_URL=""
